do_1 = "Add an explicit NodeRouteCatalogue response type and decodeNodeRouteCatalogue in sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts and use them in EndpointClient.getRouteCatalogue at sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:97; model the public services and routes projected at rpc/generate_px_catalogue.py:7 and rpc/generate_px_catalogue.py:30, rpc_paths from rpc/px_discovery.go:76, and the flat readiness variants from rpc/px_discovery.go:69, retaining node_registration scope and methods separately from unknown hosted readiness without inventing canonical_origin, private bindings or aggregate readiness; retain the existing RouteCatalogue type and decodeRouteCatalogue at sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:452 with their hosted-contract checks unchanged."
do_2 = "Add TestPxNodeCatalogueWalletSDK in rpc/px_node_catalogue_wallet_sdk_test.go using newPxRootAccountHarness at rpc/px_node_root_account_test.go:58 and its actual HTTP root server at rpc/px_node_root_account_test.go:154; pass that server URL to a mandatory child invocation of pnpm --dir ../sdk/wallet exec vitest run test/node-route-catalogue.test.ts -t '^nodeRouteCatalogueDecodesAndValidates$', propagate failures and require the named test to execute, and register the declared async function nodeRouteCatalogueDecodesAndValidates in sdk/wallet/test/node-route-catalogue.test.ts to call EndpointClient.getRouteCatalogue with and without hostedUrl against the real producer, asserting equal discovery, public-only fields, node-native inference routes, node registration methods, and hosted states remaining false with status unknown and reason hosted_dependency_not_measured; use no substitute producer, manually shaped success payload or optional-test skip."
do_3 = "In nodeRouteCatalogueDecodesAndValidates derive malformed inputs from the actual producer response and assert decodeNodeRouteCatalogue refuses wrong schema or chain, duplicate service or route IDs, dangling route service references, malformed public fields, malformed readiness variants or inventories, and invalid route bounds; retain the 4096-route bound from sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:484 and positive timeout and zero-retry checks from sdk/wallet/src/endpoint.ts:531 for hosted route contracts, while validating the distinct node_rpc route contract from rpc/generate_px_catalogue.py:39 without requiring hosted-only fields; preserve the node producer and its privacy and unknown-readiness assertions at rpc/px_node_root_account_test.go:310 unchanged."
